{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b6537237847e1ff29910b86898c58055c9eb30c025abf5dc222fa57f51fc2358", "ja": "アイドルの新人オーディションで、恵美が\r\n審査することになったのは、かつて彼女から\r\n離れていった友人だった。悩みつつも正直に\r\n審査した結果、友人は不合格となるが、恵美\r\nのことを応援しているとエールをくれる。", "zh": "在新人偶像试镜中，惠美负责评审的\n竟是曾经与她渐行渐远的朋友。惠美虽内心纠结，\n但还是秉公进行了审查，最终那位朋友并未合格，\n然而对方却为惠美送上鼓励，表示会一直支持她。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ee53d7750ef7293cf4eca750cdebdaf040bdbd2f3d993750eca262183554529f", "ja": "悪いな、わざわざ来てもらって。\nオーディション選考用の書類が届いたんだ。", "zh": "抱歉，还特意让你跑一趟。\n偶像新人选拔的资料送到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "38917e4d8cd1a7d37888c38499656d59f47a4737bbc065d6617356536469468d", "ja": "大丈夫、チャリだからさ。\nこれが資料？", "zh": "没事，我是骑自行车来的。\n这就是资料？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1002_p", "source_sha256": "1fee8f3678cb0fbc912119228d0f923f58aa0ba64c4b59924ad935a3f6c506e5", "ja": "ああ、書類選考を通った応募者だ。実技審査の前に\nひととおり目を通しておいてくれ。取扱いは厳重にな。", "zh": "啊，是通过了材料筛选的应聘者。实技考核前先大致看一遍。资料可要妥善保管。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1003_020meg", "source_sha256": "843fc7127ed17eaa283d61a31ff7406c8b2ae8c726316e8520bd22daf3b50c83", "ja": "はーい！　どれどれ～？　……うわ、可愛い！\nみんなフレッシュだな。この子とかメイク映えしそう！", "zh": "好——！我看看～？……哇，好可爱！\n大家都很有活力啊。这个孩子感觉很适合化妆！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "79d64ff3c41b497006502c9e515bae4f42a57e66c878ed9aadf63069d853214d", "ja": "この子たち、ひょっとしたら将来、アタシたちと一緒に\nお仕事するかもしれないんだよね。そっかー……", "zh": "这些孩子，说不定将来会和我们一起工作呢。这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1005_020meg", "source_sha256": "076d55ecaae782f265d4bad557aed6693eae85176dad5da84f81388c7ed0394d", "ja": "……え？", "zh": "……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1006_020meg", "source_sha256": "197047e3c464e0b4095f36d1006f4984412b7197220a574dfb6492fcaa365ba5", "ja": "あれ？　……ううん、やっぱり。\n………………。", "zh": "咦？……不，果然还是。\n………………。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1007_p", "source_sha256": "80f30243ac3333d041da1cf686761174c02c99487a232d3197d1d7308b97b8ae", "ja": "恵美？　どうした？", "zh": "惠美？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1008_020meg", "source_sha256": "85d5c64106d7998560f029e9e4bed19e3ed48f2e9f9df663da153e9956a2a297", "ja": "……あのさ、{$P$}。その……。\nえっと……。", "zh": "……那个，{$P$}。就是……\n呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1009_p", "source_sha256": "9712e1a8b938ec2c734a2280095fb36267282780574c05ec480d8fde5d7a94d5", "ja": "……？\nちょっと、場所を移そうか。", "zh": "……？\n我们换个地方吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1010_020meg", "source_sha256": "5cd61a790397866b7061abc424772bcefc2480cc5fcaac1b0555253c22ce13d1", "ja": "なんかごめんね、{$P$}。\n気、使わせちゃって。", "zh": "总觉得有点对不起你，{$P$}。\n让你费心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1011_p", "source_sha256": "e035f94253d954ce39bf15994c7d6b00bd4505ba4b1b066538bda29b308d9fe6", "ja": "いや、何かこみいった話みたいだったから。\nそれで、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "不是，刚才听起来好像是挺复杂的事。\n所以，到底怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1012_020meg", "source_sha256": "b6fa4d3723d0c1ae4c7ca82acc327ffc165d2bfda92f273bafb744838957f3f5", "ja": "あの……。前にさ、話したことあったの覚えてる？\nアタシがここに来て、初めて公演した後。", "zh": "那个……我之前跟你说过的事，你还记得吗？就是我来到这里，第一次公演之后的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "f851692efc92c1785c1d7b73c04ce0e61cb7a4f67adf175749732e0dbc855338", "ja": "地元で、中学の頃に仲良くしてた友達の話。", "zh": "就是初中时在老家玩得很好的那个朋友的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1014_p", "source_sha256": "b6b99b5c7ace88bdabe1013cec98ce3e6cc4e6bcf6485e1763a53690b51da966", "ja": "えっと……。\nもともと芸能界に憧れてたって子だっけ。確か……。", "zh": "那个……  \n是那个原本就憧憬着演艺圈的孩子吧。记得是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1015_020meg", "source_sha256": "9a0f28ab4fbfedb53f66f242a82635a97b5c4f6ce799d2d4970492f4506ba4f4", "ja": "一番に、その子に話したんだ。読モみたいに、応援して\nくれるかなって思ってたんだけど……言われちゃった。", "zh": "我第一个就跟她说了。本以为她也会像支持我做读者模特那样为我加油的……结果却被她说了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1016_020meg", "source_sha256": "60a854bc943c6bbe88affd52cc71a85c3e2d072f519ba124985c8cd58f6fc843", "ja": "「アイドルなんて、今まで興味なかったくせに！」\n……って。", "zh": "“明明以前对当偶像根本就没兴趣！”\n……对方这么说了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1017_p", "source_sha256": "24afe51d535d237e4398f841e623148e9e73bbb16f0fd86c125af72591836870", "ja": "……確か、アイドルになってからは\n疎遠になってしまったって。", "zh": "……我记得你说过，成为偶像之后\n关系就变疏远了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1018_020meg", "source_sha256": "fdc111c9d0ba7375a1bce8333986f3f06a88b585b5b28ba09aa88c314681c536", "ja": "うん。芽衣っていうんだけど……その子がね、いたの。\nこのオーディションに応募してる。", "zh": "嗯。她叫芽衣……她啊，就在那里。\n而且报名了这场选拔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1019_p", "source_sha256": "2f6e370bf492769dcca8e6bbce56880ae98ae580695537337494a1f6e81f3571", "ja": "！　そうだったのか……。\n本当にアイドルを目指し始めたんだな。", "zh": "！原来是这样啊……。\n你真的开始以偶像为目标了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1020_020meg", "source_sha256": "0bf8a099544bb7f3b000ec2eccde116aef609fe54a6df0a11154a5b6c1678294", "ja": "アタシ……。\n芽衣を審査するってことだよね。", "zh": "我……。\n也就是说，要由我来评判芽衣，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1021_p", "source_sha256": "03d0ba37c5dad0ca748513dd33cbb5c056329b71a2502e19058a3036ed2b7b7b", "ja": "そういうことになるな……。\n大丈夫か？", "zh": "也就是说……应该由我来评审芽衣，对吧。  \n你还好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1022_p", "source_sha256": "b85dcf13a521f9c612783a50b37c0adc11ca386c8b873c1b3a4786202fc33daa", "ja": "もし難しければ、今からでも断るから。\n事情が事情だし、それに……。", "zh": "要是觉得为难，我现在就去推掉。\n毕竟事出有因，而且……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1023_020meg", "source_sha256": "3304582df695bd431621f54ae0deb909f8294301e980833a54e2dde87db22dd0", "ja": "ううん、やらないと……お仕事だもん。\nアタシのために、用意してくれた……。", "zh": "不，还是得做……毕竟是工作嘛。\n这是为了我，特意准备的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1025_020meg", "source_sha256": "68b3120dd27fddf8882645e8d8ef85f44d49e4ea6812ab610131985d50a3b81e", "ja": "うん……大丈夫、できる。\nアタシ、ちゃんとやるよ、{$P$}。", "zh": "嗯……没关系，我可以的。\n我会好好表现的，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1026_p", "source_sha256": "4276f406089fdc32450b30ec9c6d93fa32111398d929342c7eb1a4d71ac912d2", "ja": "……わかった。当日は俺も付き添うから、\n何かあったらすぐに言ってくれ。……それでいいか？", "zh": "……知道了。那天我也会陪着你，\n有什么事就立刻跟我说。……这样可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1027_020meg", "source_sha256": "d4741693f2433c8b0ae22898ac933b98d613877d07f3967d75e9b5246a29b941", "ja": "うん……アリガト。", "zh": "嗯……谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1028_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1029_null", "source_sha256": "f7998115a1d3aa2fb5597039f70dd2ac506fe92b9c80b28d265769b510af7dbb", "ja": "オーディション当日", "zh": "试镜当天", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1030_odexisyonnsikai", "source_sha256": "bc79623fa3d8481c4e28f9ceb597e661893db11a99f44446489000bcf30729bf", "ja": "……11番の方、ありがとうございました。", "zh": "……第11号，非常感谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1031_020meg", "source_sha256": "927e68cf7d17cb053c22e2c1b7c4454671d999195cd3de816ac35a131e1ea22e", "ja": "（次だ。次が芽衣、12番……）", "zh": "（下一个。下一个就是芽衣，12号……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1032_020meg", "source_sha256": "1cb21bf1bc507ac6f53898d678a7dc959e2d92da5cf83003ae3d6fb09bc71989", "ja": "（もうずっと会ってないけど、元気だったかな。\n写真だと、少しあか抜けてた）", "zh": "（虽然已经很久没见了，不知道她过得还好吗。\n从照片上看，她好像变得更成熟了些。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1033_020meg", "source_sha256": "b6253e31352b58932d337d3126c3b98280e0e8a32c9fbd460a93eded67fa55d7", "ja": "（アタシのこと、今はどう思ってるんだろ……アタシが\n審査員って知ってる？　わかったらどんな顔するの？）", "zh": "（她现在会怎么看我呢……知道我是评委吗？要是知道了，会露出什么表情呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1034_020meg", "source_sha256": "1dd52caba1359f71408108857900ed1552ec43a48b25bc9f5ce0909fb98e0c68", "ja": "（……どう、思うの？）", "zh": "（……你、是怎么想的呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1035_odexisyonnsikai", "source_sha256": "fe8ec25d7c7db382bc166dbac17792854915a8ede6ffc954dd371db89c0e8956", "ja": "では、12番の方、どうぞ。", "zh": "那么，12号，请进。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1037_meei", "source_sha256": "19acb540029f76b91ef2f43d01db0c88ff2e39ebf8f3d5bd366c478c80f96142", "ja": "12番、沢野芽衣です。よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "我是12号，泽野芽衣。请多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1038_027say", "source_sha256": "6191329ed3dea9f4ac7aa91bdc01fa77a180a7930639deba2df6b5e859e72cc3", "ja": "恵美ちゃん、お疲れさま！\nどうだった！？", "zh": "恵美，辛苦了！\n情况怎么样！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1039_020meg", "source_sha256": "edca2baf1095e03049586d89fbbacd9c06f84b919db11d60904f0054fb0f8dcf", "ja": "いや～。なんか、オーディションってすごいね？\n自分が受けるより緊張したかも。ていうか、疲れた～！", "zh": "哎～。总觉得选拔真是厉害呢？\n可能比自己去参选还要紧张。或者该说，好累啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1040_052kao", "source_sha256": "a558da61d19044405d49e86c1d3ee8bb50d501b9f6beb1e132bb3de811383205", "ja": "ずっと集中して、歌やダンスを見なくちゃいけないん\nだもの。神経がすり減ってしまうわよね。", "zh": "因为必须一直集中精神观察歌唱和舞蹈嘛。真是让人心力交瘁呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1041_002chi", "source_sha256": "12572137356e9b08f406722510f12873b0672aefd571dd6ee3963669cae1bafb", "ja": "この後は、審査員それぞれの評価を持ち寄って、\n話し合って合格者を決めるのね。", "zh": "接下来要汇总每位评委的评价，通过讨论来决定合格者。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1042_010azu", "source_sha256": "186ce88b9b87bc46fb74e4683e0949969f92e211413b04c863da955b81851324", "ja": "まだ時間はあるみたいだから、ひと息入れましょうか。\n今、お茶を淹れるわね。", "zh": "看来还有时间，稍微休息一下吧。\n我现在去泡茶哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1043_020meg", "source_sha256": "5860bf5370e3e2d9d619532604da9fc59bea1e6507b4f00180acdd080b6f0a70", "ja": "アリガト！　まあ、だいたいの評価はつけてたから、\nあとは見直すくらいなんだけどね。", "zh": "谢谢！我之前基本都评完分了，接下来只要稍微检查一下就行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1044_020meg", "source_sha256": "e834913003169c2b3cb00b6d7786311a1f11ffc7b2220000f4a0e0de91041755", "ja": "でもノド乾いちゃったから超うれしい。にゃはは！", "zh": "不过我正好口渴了，所以超开心的。喵哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1045_p", "source_sha256": "6ff6845c9407a58ba0443183aee510f0fd68e42029a30d5323d100ba080ea441", "ja": "それで……。どうだったんだ？", "zh": "然后……怎么样了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1046_020meg", "source_sha256": "9899c9a247a034e22f2e02bc1d68d9b6a1593573ed6a47fc8c0ce8e4594175a8", "ja": "……っ。うん……。", "zh": "……嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1047_020meg", "source_sha256": "15e2792fb2e92319af84274bc86806b4fc57cd7a1272fe7b74170ba456717ebc", "ja": "（芽衣は……正直、まだまだって感じだった。\nすごい頑張ってたけど……）", "zh": "（芽衣……说实话，感觉还差得远。虽然她已经非常努力了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1048_020meg", "source_sha256": "70034395c2b7e781298cd20bcbdd809121a62abe710bbf8472875e0064cbc716", "ja": "（他の審査員の人達はどう思ったのかな。アタシだけ\n点数低かったら、アタシのせいで……不合格に？）", "zh": "（不知道其他评委们是怎么想的。要是只有我的分数低，那岂不是会因为我……没通过？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1049_020meg", "source_sha256": "7f2a9bec81061eb8fc17dcd91b33b76d9acb9d94babff23b0d0ebc7f1cdae320", "ja": "（せっかく本気で夢に向かって踏み出したのに。\nアタシ、芽衣の友達なのに。だったら……！）", "zh": "（明明好不容易认真地朝着梦想迈出了第一步。\n明明我是芽衣的朋友。既然这样……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1050_020meg", "source_sha256": "49fbfbdb26de648f0672f3a3123c3a1830dc39f90a8419f85d948f22576851cd", "ja": "（だったら……どうするの？\n芽衣がアタシだったらどうしてた？）", "zh": "（那样的话……要怎么办？\n如果芽衣是我，她会怎么做？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1051_020meg", "source_sha256": "926d715a1011d184655a2cc8475172470a685b1a034dc4ada447a798bf674586", "ja": "（アタシが、芽衣だったら……？）", "zh": "（如果我是芽衣……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1052_027say", "source_sha256": "5e849032a96d6840122e0c007b857ca5b06bdf98a807e9c730c8b1b0c37609a9", "ja": "……恵美ちゃん？　どうかしたの？", "zh": "……惠美？你怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1053_020meg", "source_sha256": "f2759b9c583bf089d811854c7ccf376184d3e70fe9034cf48c13a2a138caaad6", "ja": "紗代子……みんな。\n……あのね。じつはさ……。", "zh": "纱代子……大家。\n……那个，其实啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1055_027say", "source_sha256": "673c96631cbf6fb9790f53dbc36798c0c1f7d749f987aaede83551d88eb4b92f", "ja": "そうだったんだ……。", "zh": "原来是这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1056_020meg", "source_sha256": "cb5564885f62139dfa31963f380f9cbc3c054e43eab63b52bf9e1856c1f0cc99", "ja": "……にゃはは。アタシ、どうしたらいいかな。", "zh": "……呀哈哈。我该怎么办才好呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1057_010azu", "source_sha256": "36e4294bced6baa46562b18d89d8096ab821548dfca67ba29cafe86aebf5954f", "ja": "お友達の審査……難しいわね。\nどうしても応援したくなるだろうし……。", "zh": "朋友的评审……真是难办呢。\n毕竟无论如何都会忍不住想为她加油……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1058_020meg", "source_sha256": "3a0d6dbfbd9adc21ca3785408a8741aa92c9a28999d86340d599e1dd5f2ee453", "ja": "そ、そうだよね？　それに、これから伸びるのかもだし\n今日は調子悪かっただけってこともあるし！", "zh": "对、对吧？而且，说不定以后还会进步呢。也有可能只是今天状态不好而已！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1059_002chi", "source_sha256": "38d6cdbbab92a8c68b632fe9f6abce0c19ca701e905dfb74e6be23f5203d7811", "ja": "……確かに、アイドルの審査に必要なのは、\n今の実力だけじゃないと思う。", "zh": "……确实，我觉得偶像选拔所需要的，不只是现在的实力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1060_052kao", "source_sha256": "c4beb34f0e7404154210e0a1ee66737d9ad737646fec43ead2ec7196968dc28f", "ja": "可能性や雰囲気……。\nそういうのも含めてじゃないかしら。", "zh": "可能性和氛围……我想应该也包括这些吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1061_020meg", "source_sha256": "a2d713e37116f2a78a2598fcfd93ed535f159ebba0ac8c161e470030122c7844", "ja": "可能性とか、雰囲気とか……。\nそ、そんなの、あるとかないとか……わかんないよね？", "zh": "可能性或者气质什么的……\n有、有没有那种东西……根本就搞不懂吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1062_027say", "source_sha256": "77a3cc2afdf0f5184f9929671b00fe97c259cf4783504b53abac05cf2032a382", "ja": "う、うん……どうかな……？", "zh": "嗯、嗯……不好说呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1066_p", "source_sha256": "93623c2e801aa4dbbb3df7b0acdcb28f51a86311ec4789ce80e1c162e7c34b75", "ja": "わからなかったのなら、それも含めて。\n恵美が一番納得できる答えを出すのがいいと思う。", "zh": "如果不明白的话，也可以把这一点考虑进去。\n我觉得惠美只要能得出自己最信服的答案就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1067_020meg", "source_sha256": "3588d29f76bc187634a70326b992203823995c7858086240e02b3f36d6032528", "ja": "え……。アタシが……？", "zh": "诶……我……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1068_052kao", "source_sha256": "bc9524444ec7174a023c341cac2d9c9e6ce3cee1a9adf9d0208834d96f5ba337", "ja": "……そうね。大切なのは、恵美ちゃんがどう思って、\nどうする自分でいたいか……だと思うわ。", "zh": "……是啊。我认为最重要的，是惠美怎么想、\n想成为怎样的自己……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1069_002chi", "source_sha256": "b6b2bfc5f8c1cad71fcfa05905dee8dbbd30ed082e8138b11b9d5ea7cabdca7c", "ja": "所さんのお友達だったのなら、その方はきっと、\nいつもの所さんが好きだったんじゃないかしら。", "zh": "如果那位是惠美的朋友，那一定是喜欢平时的惠美吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1070_027say", "source_sha256": "48e4affcebfa9a5bfdcf52b28f735fc87cb07c288aa10e19387db4aa60bbd295", "ja": "いつもの恵美ちゃんは、思ったことをそのままぶつけて\nくれる……。だから、うれしいんだよ？", "zh": "平时的惠美，会把心里想的原原本本地告诉我……所以，我才会开心呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1071_010azu", "source_sha256": "8277064d9fc14d67448669b4143c3b56a0997ce8c4f04fb1d7eff372fe57cb9e", "ja": "……ウソのないまっすぐな気持ちで通じ合えるからこそ\n『お友達』は大事で、ありがたいのよね♪", "zh": "……正因为能用毫无虚假的真挚心意相互理解，“朋友”才显得如此珍贵，也让人心怀感激呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1072_020meg", "source_sha256": "ae7804e14b5046f12144ec03b0e0f09d5fd11da4b4a481c5c18e1402cee5e2e9", "ja": "みんな……。", "zh": "大家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1073_020meg", "source_sha256": "85fe09430e2b63fbec33704e0313da11a27953f705d4930e371eb39cc868d0c8", "ja": "あはは、なんか厳しいけど……。\nうん、そうだよね。ありがと！", "zh": "啊哈哈，虽然感觉有点严厉……\n嗯，你说得对。谢谢啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1074_020meg", "source_sha256": "6786cb1b0da2df89816629de2d5b5352e4d3af99c4f3cbd23b9249208d12c8cd", "ja": "じゃあアタシ、今の評価でまとめちゃうね。\nそうだよね。答えはもう……出てたんだもん。", "zh": "那我就按现在的评价总结一下吧。\n是啊。因为答案早就……已经揭晓了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1075_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1076_p", "source_sha256": "389eabc4f903e09f24db49c8b44dc60805c1a021f37ed6d8cb9fa203d24d015d", "ja": "（その後の最終評価で、恵美の友達は不合格となった）", "zh": "（然后……\n\n在之后的最终评定中，惠美的朋友没能通过考核。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1077_null", "source_sha256": "6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e", "ja": "数日後……", "zh": "过了几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1078_020meg", "source_sha256": "11bd0de5c20f8c05d296e755c86ac2caef0c609c2fabc127939db44043b075a7", "ja": "わーっ、ゴメン{$P$}！\nレッスン遅れちゃって！　すぐ準備するから！", "zh": "哇——对不起{$P$}！  \n我训练迟到了！马上就准备！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1079_p", "source_sha256": "ae4e50b6ea5b9bd49ec7d98b43e0c970eb559b90f0f01e59320174d1b6991ae4", "ja": "いや、連絡くれてたから大丈夫だけど……珍しいな。\nトラブルでもあったのか？", "zh": "不，你事先联系过了所以没关系的……不过还真少见呢。\n是遇到什么麻烦了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1080_020meg", "source_sha256": "e1bf265087984176055653f680a0fc04e3d49fde8a83e67d235ce8dc1ded15fe", "ja": "ううん、じつは芽衣から連絡があって。\nそれで、さっきまで話してたの。", "zh": "没有啦，其实是芽衣联络了我。\n所以刚才一直在和她说话呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1081_p", "source_sha256": "ad63124080f8112883e41eb7bcd8065b0aa22273002362b61c51d1c93e59201d", "ja": "芽衣？　オーディションに出てた友達の？\n……大丈夫だったのか？", "zh": "芽衣？就是参加试镜的那个朋友？……没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1082_020meg", "source_sha256": "a0aba91772e0e198ae9b31c79525b52a7c3542c8b665404a79bb9927d22faa8a", "ja": "うーん、やっぱり……ぎこちなかった。\nオーディション落ちたの、まだ引きずってたし。", "zh": "嗯，果然还是……有点不自然。\n她还没能释怀落选试镜这件事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1083_p", "source_sha256": "80246c2e7b4c9f0543e28391a27b22c46585add73fa3746298bd552c3689aed3", "ja": "そうか…。", "zh": "这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1084_020meg", "source_sha256": "d130f7d8cb804b2bc83ea4d995f7737dbd3990ac1fc349f3b4eae51cf5c9132d", "ja": "でもね、ぜんぜん怒ってなかった。ただ普通に聞かれ\nたんだよね。アイドルとして、どうだった？って。", "zh": "不过啊，她完全没有生气。只是很平静地问我：“作为偶像，你觉得怎么样？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1085_p", "source_sha256": "d1e11a7d55d080c7d5d8a89011fff0594a231c649c732e66111383d912cd2b9b", "ja": "それで、恵美はどう答えたんだ？", "zh": "那么，惠美是怎么回答的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1086_020meg", "source_sha256": "8d72a26843e397d183a75f4ddea352f6e847bf5d1da1110e30ac5f66548bf6e1", "ja": "正直に。感じたことを言ったよ。\nそしたら「そっか」って、言ってた。", "zh": "我就实话实说，把自己的感受告诉她了。\n然后她说：“这样啊。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1087_020meg", "source_sha256": "1124ddc7c96ab8e84da8ca6959aa71bb55c4f3330ebebb92810abb80bbd93dc2", "ja": "それで……アタシの審査なら、信じられるって。\nアイドルのアタシのこと、見てきたからって。", "zh": "所以……她说，如果是由我来评审，就可以相信。\n因为她一直都关注着身为偶像的我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1088_020meg", "source_sha256": "3b6b7feae1cfd96ee7d13d608217ae378bc76eda2c6581f623cacf7ef5966a49", "ja": "あの子……\nずっと見ててくれたの。アタシのこと……。", "zh": "那个孩子……\n一直在注视着我呢。一直在看着我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1089_p", "source_sha256": "438f5cb604847a3b62c716a9f75431846a12638733bb6324f05e19285ba2c906", "ja": "そうだったのか。すごいな。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。真厉害。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1090_020meg", "source_sha256": "42d042775a318615a6c6ec4bd146ec6960160a9177711a2889fdd5217195270d", "ja": "うん。すごいよね。ホントならアタシなんて、\n見たくなかったはずなのに。", "zh": "嗯。很厉害吧。明明按理来说，\n应该根本不想看见我这种人的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1091_020meg", "source_sha256": "4dcd68675097adf37855cf667b807071bb54416c1d31425aedb1a756eba32302", "ja": "……それでね、最後に言われたよ。", "zh": "……然后，他最后还对我说了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1092_meei", "source_sha256": "0fea98e6489bbab85242edc8436097d249cf39e1c043a1a6eece958671d685f6", "ja": "今日はありがとね。\nこれからもさ、ぜったい頑張って。", "zh": "今天谢谢你。\n今后也一定要加油。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1093_meei", "source_sha256": "831ead7e28c661e75c92bcee02ae2237b024294591ec4050dc63662305fb1e8b", "ja": "ずっと、見てるからね！", "zh": "我会一直看着你的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1094_p", "source_sha256": "2c158cd6b37160808afe09bc00dc1ab7599494db8dfc0c8bb5cc0eec38e37be3", "ja": "………………。そうか。", "zh": "………………这样啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1095_020meg", "source_sha256": "2479fad67d88a7bd906bd2fb86188fc08cda0aa1ad134042d170ad3f4796713b", "ja": "{$P$}、前に言ってくれたよね。\nわかってもらうには、アイドルを頑張るしかないって。", "zh": "{$P$}，你之前说过吧。\n想让别人理解，就只能努力成为偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1096_020meg", "source_sha256": "2d44c929d04dd06d59aeb63b392648c127cb2d8947847741c069f8022d4ba546", "ja": "それでもわかってもらえなかったら？って、\nアタシ、ホントはちょっと思ってた。", "zh": "我其实也有点想过，要是即使这样还是没法让人理解呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1097_020meg", "source_sha256": "1a8b27cf2b42eff4744e2a01f3c581a9e665d3869b2159fbf0219ae3e34dbc36", "ja": "でも、見てもらえてたんだ。\n{$P$}の言ったとおりだったね。", "zh": "可是，还是被看到了啊。\n就像{$P$}说的那样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1098_p", "source_sha256": "f0e573edf76bfd2c97a5957a89898f3609930cf5dceebde315eef68df1a1d51d", "ja": "それは、恵美が本当に頑張ったからだよ。\nあと、その友達が強い人だったからだと思う。", "zh": "那是因为惠美真的很努力。还有，我觉得也是因为那位朋友是个坚强的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1099_020meg", "source_sha256": "4fb9e72a4e6abe434670ad19f7239fb94ab42d6d7f1c7aa2078f936888a38652", "ja": "うん……。アタシ、やっぱ人に恵まれてるよね！\n劇場のみんなもいい子たちばっかだし。", "zh": "嗯……我果然很有遇上好人的运气呢！\n剧场的大家也全都是好孩子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1100_020meg", "source_sha256": "09ff0b01c7e20ba6395954c34a592de256ac475e30ea73387808231367159db9", "ja": "それに、もちろん{$P$}もね♪", "zh": "而且，当然也包括{$P$}呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1101_p", "source_sha256": "3f7d46f9e5869351a30ae19121267986283d901c9b1867ffe1377bc8dd309af7", "ja": "そう思ってもらえてるなら、よかったよ。\n何しろ、恵美を劇場に連れてきたのは俺だから。", "zh": "你能这么想，真是太好了。\n毕竟，是我把惠美带到剧场来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1102_020meg", "source_sha256": "20f5a8d4e315f0d1b0c19fbbf326e294578dd97c9410d322ee996b9b2d19629a", "ja": "だよね～。うん、連れてきてもらえてよかった♪\nアタシ、これからも　もっともっと頑張んなきゃ。", "zh": "对吧～嗯，多亏你把我带来了♪\n我今后也得更加更加努力才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1103_020meg", "source_sha256": "5552e48f9fb0099bddbf3d3f792fb1accb2baa03a976685df7f0e6719f9915f4", "ja": "公演もライブも、他のお仕事も！\nこれからも、ばんばん入れてくれていいからね！", "zh": "演出、公演，还有其他工作！以后也可以尽管给我安排更多哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1104_p", "source_sha256": "234a91b9bb871eeb4aa9c0ae60e7366837ef4aa9662c25cfe8415d61a3cd7041", "ja": "わかった。でも、まずは新曲公演だな！", "zh": "知道了。不过，首先还是要办新歌公演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1105_020meg", "source_sha256": "541ecd2e8f411f9166f623edfe9abe3abfe29d6dff6e6022856b00d376b83da5", "ja": "うん！　やるぞ～！\nちゃんと見ててくれてる人もたくさんいるし。", "zh": "嗯！要好好干一场啦～！\n也有很多人一直在关注着我们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1106_p", "source_sha256": "a6e736790696458efb860bba149a86cef7bbdb16dba171590c259f8179d0d2af", "ja": "宣伝のおかげで、前評判もいいみたいだぞ。\nファンも楽しみにしてくれてる。", "zh": "多亏了宣传，事前评价似乎也很不错哦。\n粉丝们也都很期待呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1107_020meg", "source_sha256": "e8a608157018bc7446e31a4a26d4d0606b671f810c03344d7bec7db7d0dfede9", "ja": "ホントに？　よーし、もう絶対すごいライブにする！", "zh": "真的吗？好——那我一定要办一场超棒的演唱会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_145_1108_020meg", "source_sha256": "2050729184ab6ea3c0a5e83b8337ba60cca1b08ba83ab94ad84be8dfbf65e45f", "ja": "……あ、ところでさ。{$P$}、\n前にもうひとつ、言ってくれてたこと、覚えてる？", "zh": "……啊，对了。{$P$}，\n还记得你之前跟我说过的另一件事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
